Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.55,0:01:23.33,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}谁也不能改写我的故事
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.38,0:01:24.98,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}一路都是独自一人生存
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.14,0:01:26.99,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}外面是风暴席卷电闪雷鸣
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.99,0:01:28.49,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}钟声响起 Ding Ding Dong
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.58,0:01:29.40,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}就像金刚
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.70,0:01:32.72,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}最难的十大任务 正好让我扬名立万统领天下
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.92,0:01:36.29,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我停不下来 怪物转生 从零转生 豪赌一把
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.54,0:01:38.23,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}每次下注我都倾家荡产
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.38,0:01:39.28,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}但我根本不在意
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.30,0:01:39.93,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}反正都会赢回来
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.18,0:01:41.90,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}你看见了吗 那就享受吧
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.04,0:01:43.71,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}走在街上毛线帽戴好
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.83,0:01:44.88,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我可是从不厌战
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.92,0:01:46.70,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}谁叫我报酬总是拿双份
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.24,0:01:48.70,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}吃进去多少都是荣耀
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.84,0:01:50.45,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}最终像这样成为我血肉
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.66,0:01:53.35,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}囚禁我毫无意义 放我自由
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.60,0:01:56.04,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我不必无用的担心 baby
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.09,0:01:57.77,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我正在燃烧 yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.93,0:02:00.67,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}转生在这个舞台
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.87,0:02:02.92,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}我们今夜定会横穿这城市
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.13,0:02:04.47,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}让我们开始吧
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.49,0:02:06.16,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,0)\move(960,1065,960,1130,1570,1670)}{\t(500,550,\fscx125\fscy60)}沐浴烈焰
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.04,0:02:06.60,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\move(960,1040,960,1065,1020,1120)\fad(50,100)}人生就像游戏
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.75,0:02:08.43,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}“绝对”只是假象
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.58,0:02:10.26,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}常识直接打碎
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.50,0:02:14.19,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,0)\move(960,1065,960,1130,3590,3690)}{\t(2130,2180,\fscx125\fscy60)}我们浴火而生在当下
