Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.00,0:02:15.69,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)\move(960,1040,960,1065,90,190)}“绝对”只是假象
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.87,0:02:17.65,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\bord1\fad(50,100)}常识直接打碎
